 can  play with the pros secondly the complex  political structures of the new world  with all the players in lofty would have  been far less interesting to explore  with someone in the crew who knew about  all of this but most importantly it was  Jim BAE's selfless personality that led  him to prioritize the well-being of his  people over joining in on the adventure  right away keeping his relationship with  big mom was crucial to not spark  conflict for his country as a result he  hasn't joined up with the crew yet he  doesn't feel like a real straw head yet  and still has gotten way more character  development and action and some other  crew members I feel like that is the  main reason many people have  difficulties accepting Jim Bay as part  of the crew however I will promise you  that once he joins up with the crew that  will change because not only does our  whaleshark fulfill all requirements to  be part of the crew he also brings a lot  more to the story in terms of symbolism  and personality he's someone living for  his captain and his people a truly  selfless man hey everybody thank you so  much for watching I know that this video  was a little different than usual  nonetheless I think it shows us how much  thought Oda puts into many of the  concepts introduces what are your  thoughts on Jim Bay let me know in the  comments below  a big shoutout goes to my friend Bravo  who was kind enough to help me with this  project in the unlikely case you don't  know who he is make sure to check out  his amazing work on his two channels the  link is right at the beginning of the  description also if you enjoyed this  content and want to see more of its  please don't forget to smash that like  button share the video and subscribe to  be notified for any future content of  mine or dislike don't share and  unsubscribe it's a free world people I  hope to see around next time and until  then have a great week  oh yeah and don't forget to turn your  notifications on because YouTube can  sometimes be forgetful I  [Music]
 

